(7686872, 1258816, 4008, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title. I would then expect at least two persons in the image but only see one (and a small part of a second one?) and it is not clear whether that is a random bystander or is someone important in the image. Overall, the image has a nice classic atmosphere.</td>', 'I don''t get the title. I would then expect at least two persons in the image but only see one (and a small part of a second one?) and it is not clear whether that is a random bystander or is someone important in the image. Overall, the image has a nice classic atmosphere.', '2021-02-14 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
