(7686930, 1258477, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image of these patterns in the sand, these jazz riffs on the fading day.  The minimal palette lulls one into dreaminess.  The birds are both band and audience.  The remaining pier looks like people holding hands. Such interesting interconnections.</td>', 'Fascinating image of these patterns in the sand, these jazz riffs on the fading day.  The minimal palette lulls one into dreaminess.  The birds are both band and audience.  The remaining pier looks like people holding hands. Such interesting interconnections.', '2021-02-14 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
