(7687148, 1258423, 18197, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Barroness:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing image, I thought you would blue with this one.<br/>How did you manage to get this shot?<br/>Very nice image 10 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is a miniature set for a SciFi show done by the New Zealand Weta Studios. I climbed up on a ladder near the set and shot it with my iPhone. The whole set was about 8 feet across as I remember. This is only a part of it.<br/> <br/>btw, if you ever in Welligton, make it a point to visit Weta Workshop and Weta Studios. SO Cool!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-02-15 14:47:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Barroness: Amazing image, I thought you would blue with this one.How did you manage to get this shot?Very nice image 10   This is a miniature set for a SciFi show done by the New Zealand Weta Studios. I climbed up on a ladder near the set and shot it with my iPhone. The whole set was about 8 feet across as I remember. This is only a part of it. btw, if you ever in Welligton, make it a point to visit Weta Workshop and Weta Studios. SO Cool!', '2021-02-15 14:46:39.000000', '2021-02-15 14:47:22.000000', 0),
